# Neue Haas Grotesk — Font Files Required
#
# Place the following licensed font files in this directory:
#
# Display cut (for headlines, hero text, section titles):
#   NHaasGroteskDSPro-45Lt.woff2    weight: 300
#   NHaasGroteskDSPro-55Rg.woff2    weight: 400
#   NHaasGroteskDSPro-65Md.woff2    weight: 500
#   NHaasGroteskDSPro-75Bd.woff2    weight: 700
#   NHaasGroteskDSPro-95Bl.woff2    weight: 900
#
# Text cut (for body copy, descriptions):
#   NHaasGroteskTXPro-45Lt.woff2    weight: 300
#   NHaasGroteskTXPro-55Rg.woff2    weight: 400
#   NHaasGroteskTXPro-65Md.woff2    weight: 500
#   NHaasGroteskTXPro-75Bd.woff2    weight: 700
#
# Source: https://www.linotype.com/1245/neue-haas-grotesk-family.html
# Or via MyFonts / Adobe Fonts (desktop + web license required)
#
# Until files are present, the system falls back to:
# 'Helvetica Neue', 'Arial', sans-serif
# (adequate on macOS, acceptable elsewhere)
